    Stores > Configuration > Sales > Payment Methods > Amazon Pay (Zero).
    The keys come from Seller Central > Integration Central: the merchant ID,
    the store ID of the registered application, and a public key ID with the
    private key downloaded when the key pair was created.
-->
<config xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:module:Magento_Config:etc/system_file.xsd">
    <system>
        <section id="payment">
            <group id="zero_amazonpay" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="25" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                <label>Amazon Pay (Zero)</label>
                <comment>Amazon Pay for Zero Checkout: the customer pays on Amazon's page after placing the order. Needs Amazon Pay's "Additional Payment Button" (API-created checkout sessions) enabled on the merchant account.</comment>
                <field id="active" translate="label" type="select" sortOrder="10" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Enabled</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="title" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="20" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Title</label>
                </field>
                <field id="region" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="30" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Region</label>
                    <comment>Where the Amazon Pay merchant account is registered.</comment>
                    <source_model>Zero\AmazonPay\Model\Config\Source\Region</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="sandbox" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="40" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Sandbox</label>
                    <comment>Yes: test buyers from Seller Central, no money moves.</comment>
                    <source_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Source\Yesno</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="merchant_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="50" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Merchant ID</label>
                </field>
                <field id="store_id" translate="label comment" type="text" sortOrder="60" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Store ID</label>
                    <comment>Of the application in Seller Central > Integration Central (amzn1.application-oa2-client.…).</comment>
                </field>
                <field id="public_key_id" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="70" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Public Key ID</label>
                </field>
                <field id="private_key" translate="label comment" type="textarea" sortOrder="80" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Private Key</label>
                    <comment>The PEM file's contents ("-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----" …). Stored encrypted.</comment>
                    <backend_model>Magento\Config\Model\Config\Backend\Encrypted</backend_model>
                </field>
                <field id="payment_intent" translate="label comment" type="select" sortOrder="90" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Payment Action</label>
                    <comment>Authorize and Capture: the money is taken when the customer comes back. Authorize: reserved; taken when the order is invoiced.</comment>
                    <source_model>Zero\AmazonPay\Model\Config\Source\PaymentIntent</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="allowspecific" translate="label" type="allowspecific" sortOrder="100" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Payment from Applicable Countries</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Payment\Model\Config\Source\Allspecificcountries</source_model>
                </field>
                <field id="specificcountry" translate="label" type="multiselect" sortOrder="110" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1">
                    <label>Payment from Specific Countries</label>
                    <source_model>Magento\Directory\Model\Config\Source\Country</source_model>
                    <can_be_empty>1</can_be_empty>
                </field>
                <field id="sort_order" translate="label" type="text" sortOrder="120" showInDefault="1" showInWebsite="1" showInStore="1" canRestore="1">
                    <label>Sort Order</label>
                </field>
            </group>
        </section>
    </system>
</config>
